## FPV drone
fpv-drone-deployed = Drone deployed.
fpv-drone-link-established = Link with the drone established. Press Z again to stop controlling it.
fpv-drone-link-released = You stop controlling the drone.
fpv-drone-signal-lost = Signal lost! The drone is too far from the controller.
fpv-drone-signal-jammed = Signal jammed! The drone has lost control.
fpv-drone-controller-lost = Controller lost! Connection to the drone was severed.
fpv-drone-destroyed = Drone destroyed!
fpv-drone-bound = Drone bound to the controller.
fpv-drone-busy = This drone is already controlled by someone.
fpv-drone-deploy-cooldown = The controller is not ready to deploy a new drone yet.
